					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-578302#post-1599745</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-578302/addressing-the-second#post-1599745</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 28 Oct 2012 04:30:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>GrandEnder</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>498523</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A tale detailing a figure in Daevite mythos. Or the last remorse of Agent Strelnikov. A cross-contamination between SCP-035 and SCP-682. A corrupted SCP document. SCP-140's last page. A tribe in the Bellerverse and their version of events. A non-existent figure on a council of grace and vice, where neither vices nor graces are truly evil or truly good. A memoir to ancient people, from the future.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
